# Excalidraw Ultimate settings.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` beside it (`cp .env.example .env`) and uncomment what
# you need. `.env` is ignored by Git. Every setting has exactly one name; the
# shell overrides the file, and anything omitted uses its default.

# Where the app checkout lives. Normally detected from the skill install.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_ROOT=/Users/me/excalidraw-ultimate

# Project the current command belongs to. Defaults to the git root of `pwd`.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_PROJECT=/Users/me/my-project

# App URL. Its port is also the port the dev server binds.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Chrome DevTools Protocol port for the debug browser.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_CDP_PORT=9333

# Runtime state: dev-server log and PID, debug-browser PID and profile.
# Defaults to <checkout>/.excalidraw-ultimate/runtime.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_STATE_DIR=/Users/me/.excalidraw-ultimate/runtime

# Browser binary used by `open`, `describe`, and `screenshot`.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_BROWSER=/Applications/Brave Browser.app/Contents/MacOS/Brave Browser

# Directories the app's file bridge may touch, separated by `:` (`;` on
# Windows). Defaults to empty: any path except .git and node_modules.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_ALLOWED_ROOTS=/Users/me/work:/Users/me/scratch

# Load a different settings file instead of this checkout's `.env`.
# EXCALIDRAW_ULTIMATE_ENV_FILE=/Users/me/.env
